{1}{Greetings, sir.  [This dwarf is gruff, battle-scarred.]  Might I impose on you for a moment?}{Greetings, madam.  [This dwarf is gruff, battle-scarred.]  Might I impose on you for a moment?}{}{}{}{}
{2}{Of course...}{}{5}{}{5}{}
{3}{No...I have to go immediately to the advisor's chambers...}{}{5}{}{9}{}
{5}{[He nods curtly.]  I thank you.  I will keep this brief and to the point.  My name is General Veers.  I represent the Caladonian Military...}{[He nods curtly.]  I thank you.  I will keep this brief and to the point.  My name is General Veers.  I represent the Caladonian Military...}{}{}{}{}
{6}{Hello, General.  How can I be of service?}{}{5}{}{-12}{}
{9}{[He seems angered by your refusal, but controls himself.]  I think you would be well-served to hear what I have to say, sir...}{[He seems angered by your refusal, but controls himself.]  I think you would be well-served to hear what I have to say, madam...}{}{}{}{}
{10}{Maybe you're right, General.  Please, continue...}{}{5}{}{5}{}
{11}{I told you...I've no time for things like this...}{}{5}{}{13}{}
{13}{I see.  Well, I shall be here until you enter the proceedings.  Return if you wish to speak further.}{I see.  Well, I shall be here until you enter the proceedings.  Return if you wish to speak further.}{}{}{}{}
{16}{[He studies you a moment, then seems to make a decision about you.]  Perhaps we DON'T have anything to talk about.  Only a man who is learned in the ways of combat would understand what I have to say...}{[He studies you a moment, then seems to make a decision about you.]  Perhaps we DON'T have anything to talk about.  Only a woman who is learned in the ways of combat would understand what I have to say...}{}{}{}{}
{17}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{lf2 1}
{19}{[He studies you a moment, then seems to make a decision about you.]  I can tell you're a man well-versed in the ways of war.  You might just understand our position here in the negotiations, and perhaps be able to give us some assistance....}{[He studies you a moment, then seems to make a decision about you.]  I can tell you're a woman well-versed in the ways of war.  You might just understand our position here in the negotiations, and perhaps be able to give us some assistance....}{}{}{}{}
{20}{Of course.  How might I help?}{}{5}{}{22}{}
{22}{You are aware that the Unified Kingdom requires that half of the troops of new members must serve under the Unified Battalions.  We understand this position, but we believe that Caladon needs to keep her standing army indefinitely.  If you happen to agree, and see that it becomes a part of the agreement, we'd give you a 2000 gold piece stipend.  [He winks at you.]  The spoils of war...}{You are aware that the Unified Kingdom requires that half of the troops of new members must serve under the Unified Battalions.  We understand this position, but we believe that Caladon needs to keep her standing army indefinitely.  If you happen to agree, and see that it becomes a part of the agreement, we'd give you a 2000 gold piece stipend.  [He winks at you.]  The spoils of war...}{}{}{}{gf2235 1}
{23}{I can see the validity of your point.  I'll consider it...}{}{5}{}{}{lf1 1, fl 25}
{25}{If you win this particular battle, return here after the proceedings.}{If you win this particular battle, return here after the proceedings.}{}{}{}{}
{27}{I salute you, sir! [He does so.]  You're a hero in my eyes!  [He hands you a heavy sack of gold.]  May you always be victorious...}{I salute you, madam! [He does so.]  You're a hero in my eyes!  [He hands you a heavy sack of gold.]  May you always be victorious...}{}{}{}{$$2000}
